ripe-atlas-repo (1.6-1) trixie bookworm bullseye; urgency=medium

  * Move apt source from the legacy .list to the deb822 .sources format
  * Scope the signing key to this repository via Signed-By, shipping it in
    /usr/share/keyrings instead of the globally trusted /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d
  * Remove the obsolete .list and trusted.gpg.d key conffiles on upgrade
  * Declare ca-certificates as a binary package dependency (was silently
    dropped from the source stanza)
  * Stop the packaged changelog being trimmed on Debian 12+, keeping
    apt changelog working
  * Update the uploaders in the control file

 -- RIPE Atlas Team <atlas@ripe.net>  Wed, 05 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000

